  "prefLabel": "He-W 541.03 Provider Participation",
  "priorExpiration": "2008-08-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 541.03 Provider Participation. All family planning providers shall be:\n\n(a) Licensed by the state in which she or he practices or be a NH certified midwife; and\n\n(b) A New Hampshire enrolled Medicaid provider.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #5874, eff 8-1-94; ss by #7329, eff 8-1-00, EXPIRED: 8-1-08\n\nNew. #9272, eff 9-19-08; ss by #12053, eff 11-19-16",
